      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhu%2C+Y">Yuxuan Zhu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bommasani%2C+R">Rishi Bommasani</a>
      , et al. (6 additional authors not shown)
